{"id":"91e13438a25f25a032e5b47a019a15334cab5fec","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1242905","title":"请教使用 codex 时要验证短信怎么办？","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"lianyoudan","excerpt":"OpenAI - @lianyoudan - 之前注册 openAI 账户使用了接码平台（不支持国内手机号），现在想充值 ChatGPT plus 会员，想用一下 codex 。但是在网上看到，要用 codex 可能会有验证手机短信验证码，可是之","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"Main\">\n                \n                \n<div><p>之前注册 openAI 账户使用了接码平台（不支持国内手机号），现在想充值 ChatGPT plus 会员，想用一下 codex 。但是在网上看到，要用 codex 可能会有验证手机短信验证码，可是之前的注册的手机号早没了，连接码平台都倒闭了，怎么办？</p></div>\n\n<!-- SOL tip topic -->\n\n\n\n\n\n<div>\n    <div><P><a href=\"/tag/Codex\"><li></li> Codex</a><a href=\"/tag/验证\"><li></li> 验证</a><a href=\"/tag/手机\"><li></li> 手机</a></P><p><span>21 replies &#160;<strong>•</strong> &#160;2026-09-18 17:50:12 +08:00</span>\n    </p></div>\n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18099430\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/e2f3/4833/121709_normal.png?m=1732758204\" alt=\"gooin\" data-uid=\"121709\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>2</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/gooin\">gooin</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-18 11:07:45 +08:00\">23h 29m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>新注册一个号。不要用自定义的域名邮箱，自定义的域名手邮箱开 Plus 之后，登录 CodeX ，还是要验证码。 就用微软谷歌之类的。开通 Plus 之后，登录 codex 就不要手机号了。刚开过。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18099435\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/7b1432fd9577a14116e3971df74c876b?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"giter\" data-uid=\"476845\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>3</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/giter\">giter</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-18 11:08:15 +08:00\">23h 29m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>注册新帐户，新帐号不需要验证手机号，订阅时也不会要求绑定手机号</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18099454\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/6793/4bd4/654637_normal.png?m=1782283992\" alt=\"Stargaze\" data-uid=\"654637\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>4</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Stargaze\">Stargaze</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-18 11:10:38 +08:00\">23h 26m ago</span>  &#160; <span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\"> 2</span>\n                    \n                    <p>换个手机号接码登录进去再说，然后绑定 2fa ，用账号密码加 2fa 登录，基本不会遇到手机号了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18099735\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/2c3dc859c43d7bc11d307d6a8b9100f1?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"JoeSmith\" data-uid=\"371372\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>6</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/JoeSmith\">JoeSmith</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-18 11:54:56 +08:00\">22h 42m ago via Android</span> \n                    \n                    <p>不久前还是要的，chat 不要，Codex 就要<br>难道现在变了？</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18099904\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/ddd927d69f7ccbf8e9b5a77c7b8500f5?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"yinmin\" data-uid=\"108246\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>8</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/yinmin\">yinmin</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-18 12:49:46 +08:00\">21h 47m ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>有些账号登录 codex 需要手机认证，有些不需要。</p><p>gpt 免费版也有 codex 额度的，你可以用 kilocode 登录 chatgpt oauth 用 codex 额度，看看需不需要手机认证</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18100087\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/2f51f512a6d06e560e7dceda1260b935?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"BlackSas\" data-uid=\"430263\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>9</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/BlackSas\">BlackSas</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-18 13:43:19 +08:00\">20h 54m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>像楼上说的，新注册账号不需要短信验证，我注册 claude 都没让我验证短信。<br>把 2FA 开启后，就能把短信验证的选项关闭了。<br>这样以后就不会发短信。</p><p> <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://i.imgur.com/vdtALIf.png\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/vdtALIf.png\" rel=\"noreferrer\"></a><br> <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://i.imgur.com/Oh0481Q.png\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Oh0481Q.png\" rel=\"noreferrer\"></a></p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18100475\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/a087/1963/186098_normal.png?m=1646968527\" alt=\"xooass\" data-uid=\"186098\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>10</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/xooass\">xooass</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-18 14:49:15 +08:00\">19h 48m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>我发现了规律    注册成功的时候网页版是已经登录状态的，这个时候马上去点个人设置里面的安全   把 2fa 开了 短信保持不要开   顺便把顶部的密码也设置一下</p><p>这个时候再登录 codex  就是出 2fa  而不是出短信验证   </p><p>这周已经给两个新员工这样开了 pro5x   如果不马上把 2fa 开了  登录 codex 就要手机验证码</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18100517\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/b36b/3df5/748865_normal.png?m=1749550471\" alt=\"GopFei\" data-uid=\"748865\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>11</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/GopFei\">GopFei</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-18 14:56:55 +08:00\">19h 40m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>saily 上注册了一个老美手机号，但是我手机没有 esim ，pdd 买个小白卡直接导进去。<br>然后注册 google,google play 走日区下载 chatgpt ，走招行 visa 支付。最近小日子的汇率比较美丽，能省下十几二十。</p><p>之前没用手机号注册的 google ，已经被收回了，但是缴费的 chatgpt 还能继续用，怕哪天需要重新登录验证邮箱啥的，就没有继续。</p><p>n 年前的 google 账号依旧持续可登</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18100735\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/09cf/1489/168520_normal.png?m=1728625721\" alt=\"aihttp\" data-uid=\"168520\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>14</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/aihttp\">aihttp</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-18 15:38:58 +08:00\">18h 58m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>今天用 Gmail 邮箱注册 OpenAI 账号，网页版直接登录，在登录 Codex Desktop 时要求手机号接码，GG 卡被封了，幸亏还有个乌龟卡。</p><p>可惜早点没刷到楼上大佬回复，网页注册账号后，要先开 2FA 关闭短信验证，后续再登录 Codex <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://i.imgur.com/NIvxivj.png\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/NIvxivj.png\" rel=\"noreferrer\"></a></p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18100814\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/0176/c2d2/242535_normal.png?m=1782464812\" alt=\"timeance\" data-uid=\"242535\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>15</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/timeance\">timeance</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-18 15:51:46 +08:00\">18h 45m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>绑定 2FA ，然后该用用，不会验证手机号的。</p><p>另外你的顾虑是存在的，要大胆一些 codex 的代码和记忆都在本地 换一个号也没什么成本</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18101022\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/11f587e817a8ccae2b58323bb2822f6a?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"quan01994\" data-uid=\"440554\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>17</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/quan01994\">quan01994</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-18 16:26:40 +08:00\">18h 10m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>你先充值 PLUS 就行 ， 开完 PLUS ，codex 验证就会没了，</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18101055\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/a2f46141d7417f344af0d61e55eba18b?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"HermanS\" data-uid=\"577713\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>18</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/HermanS\">HermanS</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-18 16:30:39 +08:00\">18h 6m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>现在是有点麻烦了，要方便的话，可以去找别人充值好的成品号用</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18101469\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/a994/9276/92938_normal.png?m=1752907488\" alt=\"iilxy\" data-uid=\"92938\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>20</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/iilxy\">iilxy</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-18 17:42:42 +08:00\">16h 54m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>充钱确实能解决，付了钱就不验证了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18101517\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/8d5bc0bb45d390ccfd0b7c3754048da7?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"leesifox3\" data-uid=\"498422\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>21</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/leesifox3\">leesifox3</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-18 17:50:12 +08:00\">16h 47m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>gmail 关联账号 + 2fa 还需要手机验证 /😓</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n            </div></DIV>","content_text":"之